message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  Integrated real-time control of blue-green infrastructure in the
  Astlingen benchmark
abstract: >-
  SWMM models, control scripts and objective function evaluation for two
  Astlingen scenarios: swales coupled to groundwater and the combined
  sewer, and blue roofs coupled to the combined sewer.
type: software
